  "title": "MBX Biosciences Announces Pricing of Initial Public Offering",
  "summary": "CARMEL, Ind., Sept. 12, 2024 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — MBX Biosciences, Inc. (Nasdaq: MBX) (“MBX Biosciences”), a clinical-stage biopharmaceutical company focused on the discovery and development of novel precision peptide therapies for the treatment of endocrine and metabolic disorders, today announced the pricing of its initial public offering of 10,200,000 shares of its common stock at […]",
